nables Efficient Knowledge Internalization","tldr":"Speculative Self-Distillation lets the student write rollouts and hands control to the teacher only where the two strongly disagree, matching on-policy accuracy with 38 to 69% fewer supervised tokens."},{"id":"2611.05609","date":"2026-11-06","title":"On the Generalization Limitation of On-Policy Distillation for Post-RL Consolidation","tldr":"Merging several specialist models into one with on-policy distillation reaches near-teacher scores on training tasks yet loses ground on harder or combined tasks, unless supervision is also broadened."},{"id":"2611.05306","date":"2026-11-05","title":"You don't need long context","tldr":"NVIDIA researchers show frontier models keep most of their accuracy on long-horizon and long-input tasks when forced to work in short contexts through frequent compaction."},{"id":"2611.02846","date":"2026-11-05","title":"SpecOPD: Branch-Parallel On-Policy Distillation for Speculative Decoding","tldr":"SpecOPD trains speculative-decoding draft models on their own sampled outputs in parallel branches, lifting accepted-token length by up to 41% and training throughput 16x."},{"id":"2611.03097","date":"2026-11-04","title":"DR Pixel: Page-Native Deep Research with Vision-Language Models","tldr":"DR Pixel does deep research directly on rendered page images instead of OCR text, and a step-weighted fine-tuning method lifts a 27B open model to GPT-5.4-level accuracy."},{"id":"2610.42149","date":"2026-11-02","title":"Latent Reasoning in Continuous Space for Unified Multimodal Models","tldr":"LARC lets a unified image model think in continuous hidden states instead of text before drawing, trained with a curriculum and a self-supervised information-gain reward, and it improves with more thinking."},{"id":"2610.38095","date":"2026-11-01","title":"Nemotron 3.5 Super and Lightning: Open, Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Hybrid Mamba-Transformer Models for Agentic AI","tldr":"NVIDIA's open Nemotron 3.5 Super, a 120B-parameter hybrid Mamba-Transformer mixture-of-experts with 12B active, adds a built-in drafter and 4-bit weights, reaching 51.78% on SWE-bench Pro."},{"id":"2610.40618","date":"2026-11-01","title":"An ODE-based Sampler for Discrete Diffusion Models","tldr":"Exponential residual flows give discrete diffusion language models an analogue of the probability-flow ODE: after one random draw, sampling is deterministic yet provably keeps the right distributions, enabling consistency distillation."},{"id":"2610.38681","date":"2026-10-30","title":"Weaken to Strengthen: Weakening-Induced On-Policy Self-Distillation for Large Reasoning Models","tldr":"WISD improves reasoning models with no labels or stronger teacher by training them toward tokens the original model prefers over a deliberately quantized or pruned copy of itself, adding 4 to 5.5 points on average."},{"id":"2610.38355","date":"2026-10-29","title":"FlatCake: A Flat KVCache Storage Architecture for LLM Serving","tldr":"FlatCake stores LLM key-value caches on DRAM and SSD as equal peers rather than a DRAM-over-SSD hierarchy, keeping a 94% hit rate on a Claude Code trace where Mooncake falls to 64%."}]}